ProtocolFeeCollector::setCollateralOperator
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when operator is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorZeroAddress
    ├── when operator already has the requested status
    │   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorNoStateChange
    ├── when enabling a new collateral operator
    │   ├── it should set isCollateralOperator to true
    │   └── it should emit CollateralOperatorSet
    └── when disabling an existing collateral operator
        ├── it should set isCollateralOperator to false
        └── it should emit CollateralOperatorSet
